eo streaming. Central to the diagram is "Cloud Processing" for centralized computation and coordination. On the left, "Storage Management" handles content storage and retrieval, feeding da\ta input into cloud processing. On the right, "Resource Management" dynamically allocates resources, providing resource updates to cloud processing. Below, processed data flows to "Edge Nodes" for low-latency content delivery, and optimized streams are se\nt to the "Content Delivery Network \(CDN\)" for global content distribution. The architecture emphasizes integration of cloud processing with storage and resource management for efficient video streaming.\r\n␀)/K 2/P 12871 0 R/Pg 449 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj12889 0 obj<</K 3/P 12871 0 R/Pg 449 0 R/S/Caption/Type/StructElem>>endobj12890 0 obj<</K 5/P 12871 0 R/Pg 449 0 R/S/H2/Type/StructElem>>endobj12891 0 obj<</K[6 13297 0 R 8]/P 12871 0 R/Pg 449 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj12892 0 obj<</K[9 13295 0 R 11]/P 12871 0 R/Pg 449 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj12893 0 obj<</K 3/P 12871 0 R/Pg 453 0 R/S/H3/Type/StructElem>>endobj12894 0 obj<</K[4 13291 0 R 6 13292 0 R 8]/P 12871 0 R/Pg 453 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj12895 0 obj<</K 10/P 12871 0 R/Pg 453 0 R/S/H4/Type/StructElem>>endobj12896 0 obj<</K[11 13289 0 R 13]/P 12871 0 R/Pg 453 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj12897 0 obj<</K 15/P 12871 0 R/Pg 453 0 R/S/H4/Type/StructElem>>endobj12898 0 obj<</K 16/P 12871 0 R/Pg 453 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj12899 0 obj<</K[17 13287 0 R 19]/P 12871 0 R/Pg 453 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj12900 0 obj<</K[20 13285 0 R 22]/P 12871 0 R/Pg 453 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj12901 0 obj<</K[23 13283 0 R 25]/P 12871 0 R/Pg 453 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj12902 0 obj<</K 27/P 12871 0 R/Pg 453 0 R/S/H4/Type/StructElem>>endobj12903 0 obj<</K 28/P 12871 0 R/Pg 453 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj12904 0 obj<</A 13282 0 R/Alt(Line graph showing storage usage over 10 days in terabyt